{"thought": "Found the largest one-day closing price percentage gain by calculating daily returns for all instruments and ordering by the maximum gain.", "final": {"value": "SPANDANA", "sql": "WITH daily_returns AS (SELECT i.ticker, p.date, p.close, LAG(p.close) OVER (PARTITION BY p.instrument_id ORDER BY p.date) as prev_close, (p.close / LAG(p.close) OVER (PARTITION BY p.instrument_id ORDER BY p.date) - 1) as daily_return FROM prices p JOIN instruments i ON p.instrument_id = i.instrument_id) SELECT ticker, date, daily_return FROM daily_returns WHERE daily_return IS NOT NULL ORDER BY daily_return DESC LIMIT 1"}}
